  m_Name: ArcadeGameGlasshouse
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 89
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Glasshouse
  Description: 'Anglers only - a timed garden. Every omni crystal is a creature and a seed. Let go of
    the lure and the seed is planted in your colour, and the lure light grows every plant in
    reach three times as fast. Your score is the mass standing in your colour when the clock
    runs out - your trail and your garden. Wild herds graze every garden outside the core,
    and a rival paints your plants to throw a school at them. Higher intensities thin the
    seeds, bring more grazers and leave less room to grow.'
